 "remarks": "Rarely available and ready for its next chapter, this expansive 1,371 sq ft residence offers what downtown Stamford buyers chase and seldom find: real space, all on one level, in the heart of the city. Set on the sixth floor of a brick elevator building, this 2-bedroom, 2-bath home lives large, with central air, generous proportions, and an open, flowing layout suited to both quiet mornings and easy entertaining.  The location delivers. You're minutes from the Metro-North station (Grand Central in roughly an hour), Mill River Park, Stamford Town Center, and the restaurants, cafes, and energy that make downtown one of Fairfield County's most sought-after addresses. The building rounds it out with standout shared amenities: a top-floor indoor pool and gym, a third-floor dog park, and a community gas grill area perfect for warm-weather gatherings.  This is comfortable, low-maintenance city living with room to spread out. Homes of this size in this location don't last.",
